Hello, all,
   Just had a thought/suggestion for saved games. When you save a game, NH
could allow you to entire a line (or maybe even more) of text that would be
displayed back at you when you restarted it.
   One of the best examples for this is to keep track of whether or not your
pet has died, if there's stores on certain levels, altar locations, etc. This
would certainly make it easier than keeping a piece of paper around between
games (only to lose it just as you get ready to start again...)
   Thoughts, comments, etc. from anybody?

